        ev=["11th century", "temple destruction", "Ghaznavid and Ghurid invasions", "local rulers, merchant guilds, and religious communities", "maintained and restored temples", "continue functioning", "less visible locations", "havelī temple", "adapted temple architecture to avoid destruction"],
